          hit (10.0,6.5) [230.0 x 19.0] "vector:/missing/yro.slashdot.org/story/25/12/19/2317247/google-sues-serpapi-over-scraping-and-reselling-search-data"
          text (10.0,6.5) [230.0 x 19.0] rgba=FFFFFFFF f=17/700 "Google Sues SerpApi Over Scraping and "
          hit (10.0,30.5) [126.0 x 19.0] "vector:/missing/yro.slashdot.org/story/25/12/19/2317247/google-sues-serpapi-over-scraping-and-reselling-search-data"
          text (10.0,30.5) [126.0 x 19.0] rgba=FFFFFFFF f=17/700 "Reselling Search Data"
          rect (136.0,31.5) [14.0 x 14.0] rgba=00000000
           hit (15.0,5.0) [99.0 x 14.0] "vector:/missing/searchengineland.com/google-sues-serpapi-466541"
           text (15.0,5.0) [99.0 x 14.0] rgba=FFCCCC93 f=12/400 "(searchengineland.com) "
         rect (0.0,56.0) [407.18399999 x 32.4] rgba=FFF2F2F2
          text (30.0,8.19999999) [3.0 x 16.0] rgba=00000000 f=14/400 " "
        rect (0.0,88.4) [407.18399999 x 560.0] rgba=00000000
         rect (20.0,20.0) [367.18399999 x 540.0] rgba=00000000
          text (0.0,0.0) [367.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "An anonymous reader quotes a report from Search Engine Land: "
          rect (8.0,27.0) [351.18399999 x 494.0] rgba=00000000
           text (16.0,0.0) [43.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "Google "
           hit (59.0,0.0) [25.0 x 19.0] "vector:/missing/blog.google/technology/safety-security/serpapi-lawsuit/"
           text (59.0,0.0) [25.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF666600 f=17/400 "said"
           text (84.0,0.0) [247.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 " today that it is suing SerpApi, accusing the "
           text (16.0,19.0) [68.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "company of "
           hit (84.0,19.0) [234.0 x 19.0] "vector:/missing/searchengineland.com/google-sues-serpapi-466541"
           text (84.0,19.0) [234.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF666600 f=17/400 "bypassing security protections to scrape, "
           hit (16.0,38.0) [299.0 x 19.0] "vector:/missing/searchengineland.com/google-sues-serpapi-466541"
           text (16.0,38.0) [299.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF666600 f=17/400 "harvest, and resell copyrighted content from Google "
           hit (16.0,57.0) [82.0 x 19.0] "vector:/missing/searchengineland.com/google-sues-serpapi-466541"
           text (16.0,57.0) [82.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF666600 f=17/400 "Search results"
           text (98.0,57.0) [221.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 ". The allegations: Google said SerpApi: "
           text (16.0,76.0) [3.0 x 19.0] rgba=00000000 f=17/400 " "
           text (16.0,95.0) [326.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "-Circumvented Google's security measures and industry-"
           text (16.0,114.0) [158.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "standard crawling controls."
           text (16.0,133.0) [326.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "-Ignored website directives that specify whether content "
           text (16.0,152.0) [96.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "can be accessed."
           text (16.0,171.0) [304.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "-Used cloaking, rotating bot identities, and large bot "
           text (16.0,190.0) [207.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "networks to scrape content at scale."
           text (16.0,209.0) [314.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "-Took licensed content from Search features, including "
           text (16.0,228.0) [295.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "images and real-time data, and resold it for profit. "
           text (16.0,247.0) [3.0 x 19.0] rgba=00000000 f=17/400 " "
           text (16.0,266.0) [308.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "What Google is saying. "Stealthy scrapers like SerpApi "
           text (16.0,285.0) [325.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "override [crawling] directives and give sites no choice at "
           text (16.0,304.0) [320.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "all," Google wrote, calling the alleged scraping "brazen" "
           text (16.0,323.0) [325.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "and "unlawful." Google said SerpApi's activity "increased "
           text (16.0,342.0) [294.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "dramatically over the past year." [...] If Google wins, "
           text (16.0,361.0) [305.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "reliable SERP data could become harder to get, more "
           text (16.0,380.0) [305.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "expensive, or both -- especially for teams that rely on "
           text (16.0,399.0) [300.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "tools powered by services like SerpApi. As AI already "
           text (16.0,418.0) [306.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "reduces clicks and transparency, Google now appears "
           text (16.0,437.0) [329.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "intent on making it even harder for brands to understand "
           text (16.0,456.0) [328.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "how Search works, how they appear in results, and how to "
           text (16.0,475.0) [100.0 x 19.0] rgba=FF000000 f=17/400 "measure success."
          text (0.0,521.0) [3.0 x 19.0] rgba=00000000 f=17/400 " "
